<text >1. Select your project with `$CurrentBookProject` for Export Agent
	2.	Use the stamp “Export: Toggle Export and Preview mode” to switch from Preview mode to Export mode.

3. Select notes under Export Agent.
￼

4. Export  
	&quot;Export Selected Note(s)&quot; from Menu.
 
　A folder with the same name as the $HTMLExportFileName of the Book project selected in $CurrentBookProject is created, and the content is exported into it. (Previously, the folder name was fixed to &quot;output&quot;.)


</text>
