<text >GN_Area:Indicates the preferred area for a node or empty cluster
GN_Class:Classnames to attach to the node, edge, graph, or cluster&apos;s SVG element
GN_Color:Basic drawing color for graphics, not text
GN_Colorscheme:A color scheme namespace: the context for interpreting color names
GN_Comment:Comments are inserted into output
GN_Distortion:Distortion factor for shape=polygon
GN_Fillcolor:Color used to fill the background of a node or cluster
GN_Fixedsize:Whether to use the specified width and height attributes to choose node size (rather than sizing to fit the node contents)
GN_Fontcolor:Color used for text
GN_Fontname:Font used for text
GN_Fontsize:Font size, in points, used for text
GN_Gradientangle:If a gradient fill is being used, this determines the angle of the fill
GN_Group:Name for a group of nodes, for bundling edges avoiding crossings
GN_Height:Height of node, in inches
GN_Href:Synonym for URL
GN_Id:Identifier for graph objects
GN_Image:Gives the name of a file containing an image to be displayed inside a node
GN_Imagepos:Controls how an image is positioned within its containing node
GN_Imagescale:Controls how an image fills its containing node
GN_Label:Text label attached to objects
GN_Labelloc:Vertical placement of labels for nodes, root graphs and clusters
GN_Layer:Specifies layers in which the node, edge or cluster is present
GN_Margin:For graphs, this sets x and y margins of canvas, in inches
GN_Nojustify:Whether to justify multiline text vs the previous text line (rather than the side of the container)
GN_Ordering:Constrains the left-to-right ordering of node edges
GN_Orientation:node shape rotation angle, or graph orientation
GN_Penwidth:Specifies the width of the pen, in points, used to draw lines and curves
GN_Peripheries:Set number of peripheries used in polygonal shapes and cluster boundaries
GN_Pin:Keeps the node at the node&apos;s given input position
GN_Pos:Position of node, or spline control points
GN_Rects:Rectangles for fields of records, in points
GN_Regular:If true, force polygon to be regular
GN_Root:Specifies nodes to be used as the center of the layout
GN_Samplepoints:Gives the number of points used for a circle/ellipse node
GN_Shape:Sets the shape of a node
GN_Shapefile:A file containing user-supplied node content
GN_Showboxes:Print guide boxes for debugging
GN_Sides:Number of sides when shape=polygon
GN_Skew:Skew factor for shape=polygon
GN_Sortv:Sort order of graph components for ordering packmode packing
GN_Style:Set style information for components of the graph
GN_Target:If the object has a URL, this attribute determines which window of the browser is used for the URL
GN_Tooltip:Tooltip (mouse hover text) attached to the node, edge, cluster, or graph
GN_Url:Hyperlinks incorporated into device-dependent output
GN_Vertices:Sets the coordinates of the vertices of the node&apos;s polygon, in inches
GN_Width:Width of node, in inches
GN_Xlabel:External label for a node or edge
GN_Xlp:Position of an exterior label, in points
GN_Z:Z-coordinate value for 3D layouts and displays</text>
