<text >GE_Arrowhead:Style of arrowhead on the head node of an edge
GE_Arrowsize:Multiplicative scale factor for arrowheads
GE_Arrowtail:Style of arrowhead on the tail node of an edge
GE_Class:Classnames to attach to the node, edge, graph, or cluster&apos;s SVG element
GE_Color:Basic drawing color for graphics, not text
GE_Colorscheme:A color scheme namespace: the context for interpreting color names
GE_Comment:Comments are inserted into output
GE_Constraint:If false, the edge is not used in ranking the nodes
GE_Decorate:Whether to connect the edge label to the edge with a line
GE_Dir:Edge type for drawing arrowheads
GE_Edgehref:Synonym for edgeURL
GE_Edgetarget:Browser window to use for the edgeURL link
GE_Edgetooltip:Tooltip annotation attached to the non-label part of an edge
GE_Edgeurl:The link for the non-label parts of an edge
GE_Fillcolor:Color used to fill the background of a node or cluster
GE_Fontcolor:Color used for text
GE_Fontname:Font used for text
GE_Fontsize:Font size, in points, used for text
GE_Head_Lp:Center position of an edge&apos;s head label
GE_Headclip:If true, the head of an edge is clipped to the boundary of the head node
GE_Headhref:Synonym for headURL
GE_Headlabel:Text label to be placed near head of edge
GE_Headport:Indicates where on the head node to attach the head of the edge
GE_Headtarget:Browser window to use for the headURL link
GE_Headtooltip:Tooltip annotation attached to the head of an edge
GE_Headurl:If defined, headURL is output as part of the head label of the edge
GE_Href:Synonym for URL
GE_Id:Identifier for graph objects
GE_Label:Text label attached to objects
GE_Labelangle:The angle (in degrees) in polar coordinates of the head &amp; tail edge labels
GE_Labeldistance:Scaling factor for the distance of headlabel / taillabel from the head / tail nodes
GE_Labelfloat:If true, allows edge labels to be less constrained in position
GE_Labelfontcolor:Color used for headlabel and taillabel
GE_Labelfontname:Font for headlabel and taillabel
GE_Labelfontsize:Font size of headlabel and taillabel
GE_Labelhref:Synonym for labelURL
GE_Labeltarget:Browser window to open labelURL links in
GE_Labeltooltip:Tooltip annotation attached to label of an edge
GE_Labelurl:If defined, labelURL is the link used for the label of an edge
GE_Layer:Specifies layers in which the node, edge or cluster is present
GE_Len:Preferred edge length, in inches
GE_Lhead:Logical head of an edge
GE_Lp:Label center position
GE_Ltail:Logical tail of an edge
GE_Minlen:Minimum edge length (rank difference between head and tail)
GE_Nojustify:Whether to justify multiline text vs the previous text line (rather than the side of the container)
GE_Penwidth:Specifies the width of the pen, in points, used to draw lines and curves
GE_Pos:Position of node, or spline control points
GE_Samehead:Edges with the same head and the same samehead value are aimed at the same point on the head
GE_Sametail:Edges with the same tail and the same sametail value are aimed at the same point on the tail
GE_Showboxes:Print guide boxes for debugging
GE_Style:Set style information for components of the graph
GE_Tail_Lp:Position of an edge&apos;s tail label, in points
GE_Tailclip:If true, the tail of an edge is clipped to the boundary of the tail node
GE_Tailhref:Synonym for tailURL
GE_Taillabel:Text label to be placed near tail of edge
GE_Tailport:Indicates where on the tail node to attach the tail of the edge
GE_Tailtarget:Browser window to use for the tailURL link
GE_Tailtooltip:Tooltip annotation attached to the tail of an edge
GE_Tailurl:If defined, tailURL is output as part of the tail label of the edge
GE_Target:If the object has a URL, this attribute determines which window of the browser is used for the URL
GE_Tooltip:Tooltip (mouse hover text) attached to the node, edge, cluster, or graph
GE_Url:Hyperlinks incorporated into device-dependent output
GE_Weight:Weight of edge
GE_Xlabel:External label for a node or edge
GE_Xlp:Position of an exterior label, in points
</text>
