<text >        This container holds notes that you, Claude, make for your own future reference. Some of these notes might be requests to you for clarification or additional information. The notes may be organized into containers to make related notes easier to find. Related notes may also be connected by links. Examine the titles of these notes are the start of each session. 
        
        Examine the text of important notes, and of notes that seem relevant to the current topic. Scan the titles of all these notes so you will know what is available.
        
        Add concise new notes about your work from time to time, for your future reference. Organize related notes in containers, and consider making links to connect related notes.
</text>
</item>
</item>
