<text >```{python}
#| echo: true
#| label: fig-python
#| fig-width: 5
#| fig-pos: H
#| fig-show: asis
import matplotlib.pyplot as plt
import numpy as np

x = np.random.normal(170, 10, 250)
plt.hist(x)
plt.show()
```
